OL,3,AWitness gets combative in Tupac murder
OL,4,Atrial - 'I don't want to send him to
OL,5,Aprison'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA member of Tupac Shakur's entourage
OL,8,Fwas combative in testimony during the
OL,9,Fsecond day of the rapper's murder
OL,10,Ftrial, decrying being forced to take
OL,11,Fthe stand and identify those
OL,12,Fresponsible for Shakur's death.
OL,14,FJames "Mob James" McDonald said he was
OL,15,Fthreatened with being held in contempt
OL,16,Fof court if he did not testify on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,19,FDuane "Keffe D" Davis is charged with
OL,20,Fmurder and accused of orchestrating
OL,21,FShakur's death. He has denied the
OL,22,Fcharges and pleaded not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
