OL,3,AWitness gets combative in Tupac murder
OL,4,Atrial - 'I don't want to send him to
OL,5,Aprison'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMcDonald was asked repeatedly over
OL,8,Fwhether he could identify who was
OL,9,Fresponsible for Shakur's death. "You're
OL,10,Fasking me something that wouldn't be
OL,11,Fgood for him," he said pointing to
OL,12,FDavis. "I'm not going to send him to
OL,13,Fprison, you are."
